md"""
Check that the outline below is correct.

If not, try adjusting the slider. 

If that still doesn't work, try selecting the droplet region with a bit more clearance around the droplet and more of the needle region. 

If that also doesn't work, your droplet photo might not be well-lit enough or have high enough resolution to work with the edge detection method. 
